  treatment of preterm labor", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE We compared the safety of celecoxib, a selective                  
  cyclo-oxygenase-2 inhibitor, with the safety of the nonselective cyclo-oxygenase inhibitor indomethacin, when it was  
  administered for treatment of preterm labor. STUDY DESIGN In a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial,    
