  labor was superior to that of indomethacin."}, {"study_index": 5, "title": "A randomized double‐blind study           
  comparing the fetal effects of sulindac to terbutaline during the management of preterm labor", "abstract":           
  "OBJECTIVE The object of this study was to compare the fetal effects of sulindac and terbutaline used in the          
