│ vitro studies."}, {"study_index": 31, "title": "Maternal plasma corticotrophin‐releasing hormone ‐ elevated in       │
│ preterm labour but unaffected by indomethacin or nylidrin", "abstract": "The role of corticotrophin-releasing        │
│ hormone (CRH) in preterm labour was studied in 23 women in preterm labour at between 26 and 33 weeks gestation who   │
