│ these individuals.Wiley Online Library"}, {"study_index": 34, "title": "Catechol‐O‐methyltransferase activity in red │
│ blood cells in threatened preterm labor: effect of indomethacin and nylidrin", "abstract": "Catecholamines that are  │
