│ of the ductus arteriosus. In this series no problems were encountered with the use of indomethacin.europepmc.org"},  │
│ {"study_index": 40, "title": "Lack of effect of antenatal indomethacin on fetal cerebral blood flow", "abstract":    │
│ "OBJECTIVE Our purpose was to investigate fetal cerebral blood flow and the incidence of intraventricular hemorrhage │
